fied","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p></p><h2>CAT6 Pass Through RJ45 Connectors</h2>This innovative RJ45 8P8C connector simplifies twisted pair terminations by allowing the wires to be inserted through the connector completely and out the front. This allows users to easily verify the proper wiring order. Because this also allows to tightly pull the connector down over the cable jacket it seats more tightly in the rear of the connector as well. This reduces the distance between the wire twists and contacts and improves performance.<p></p><p><br></p><p>No more wasted crimps! More reliable higher performance.</p><p>8P8C connections (8 ports for 8 cables with 8 connectors)</p><p>Designed for Stranded Cable - Not suitable for solid</p><p>Fits all RJ45 crimper tools</p><p>Supplied in packs of 10</p><p>Practical pass-through design for easy crimping</p><p>Gold plated 2-fork internal contacts for stranded LAN cables</p><p>Suitable for conductors of max. 24 AWG</p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"E Link CAT6 Pass Through RJ45 Connectors","href":"/e-link-cat6-pass-through-rj45-connectors","now":"5৳","old":"6৳","single":""},{"name":"298 RJ45 CAT6 Connector","href":"/298-rj45-cat6-connector","now":"","old":"","single":"5৳"},{"name":"CAT6 Pass Through RJ45 Connectors","href":"/cat6-pass-through-rj45-connectors","now":"","old":"","single":"5৳"},{"name":"UGREEN NW120 60558 Cat6 UTP RJ45 Connector","href":"/ugreen-nw120-60558-cat6-utp-rj45-connector","now":"","old":"","single":"7৳"},{"name":"ONV CAT6 RJ45 Connector","href":"/onv-cat6-rj45-connector","now":"","old":"","single":"5৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"